  "_comment": "Finish templates for BOQ generation from a blueprint. Each row names its catalog material by keywords (any one option, all of its words must appear in the material name) — catalog ids differ between databases. basis: floor_area | ceiling_area | wall_net_area | wall_net_area_x2 | perimeter | door_count | window_count. note_pattern pre-selects the template from a finish note on the plan (case-insensitive). Review with app/scripts/build_templates_from_history.py.",
